-a-meeting" data-v-74bb060e><!--[--><p class="text" data-v-74bb060e><span class="sidebar-endpoint"><span class="sidebar-method sidebar-method--patch">PATCH</span><span class="sidebar-endpoint__label">Rename meeting</span></span></p><!--]--></a><!----></div><!----></div><div class="VPSidebarItem level-1 is-link" data-v-74bb060e><div class="item" data-v-74bb060e><div class="indicator" data-v-74bb060e></div><a class="VPLink link link" href="/api/meetings#delete-a-meeting" data-v-74bb060e><!--[--><p class="text" data-v-74bb060e><span class="sidebar-endpoint"><span class="sidebar-method sidebar-method--del">DEL</span><span class="sidebar-endpoint__label">Delete meeting</span></span></p><!--]--></a><!----></div><!----></div><div class="VPSidebarItem level-1 is-link" data-v-74bb060e><div class="item" data-v-74bb060e><div class="indicator" data-v-74bb060e></div><a class="VPLink link link" href="/api/meetings#regenerate-notes" data-v-74bb060e><!--[--><p class="text" data-v-74bb060e><span class="sidebar-endpoint"><span class="sidebar-method sidebar-method--post">POST</span><span class="sidebar-endpoint__label">Regenerate notes</span></span></p><!--]--></a><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></nav></aside><div class="VPContent has-sidebar" id="VPContent" data-v-6dabbaee data-v-c0f1f55f><div class="VPDoc has-sidebar has-aside" data-v-c0f1f55f data-v-fd2f0f74><!--[--><!--]--><div class="container" data-v-fd2f0f74><div class="aside" data-v-fd2f0f74><div class="aside-curtain" data-v-fd2f0f74></div><div class="aside-container" data-v-fd2f0f74><div class="aside-content" data-v-fd2f0f74><div class="VPDocAside" data-v-fd2f0f74 data-v-f129a94b><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><nav aria-labelledby="doc-outline-aria-label" class="VPDocAsideOutline" data-v-f129a94b data-v-61a60dbc><div class="content" data-v-61a60dbc><div class="outline-marker" data-v-61a60dbc></div><div aria-level="2" class="outline-title" id="doc-outline-aria-label" role="heading" data-v-61a60dbc>On this page</div><ul class="VPDocOutlineItem root" data-v-61a60dbc data-v-e88eb560><!--[--><!--]--></ul></div></nav><!--[--><!--]--><div class="spacer" data-v-f129a94b></div><!--[--><!--]--><!----><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="content" data-v-fd2f0f74><div class="content-container" data-v-fd2f0f74><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><div class="doc-actions"><nav class="doc-actions__breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/api/">API reference</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Text to Speech</span></nav><button type="button"><svg class="doc-actions__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="11" height="11" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"></path></svg> Copy page link</button><span class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite"></span></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><main class="main" data-v-fd2f0f74><div style="position:relative;" class="vp-doc _api_tts" data-v-fd2f0f74><div><h1 id="text-to-speech" tabindex="-1">Text to Speech <a class="header-anchor" href="#text-to-speech" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Text to Speech&quot;">​</a></h1><p>Generate mono, 16-bit PCM WAV audio at 24 kHz. Use a server-side API key with <code>tts:write</code> permission.</p><h2 id="choose-a-model-and-compatible-voice" tabindex="-1">Choose a model and compatible voice <a class="header-anchor" href="#choose-a-model-and-compatible-voice" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Choose a model and compatible voice&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Use a key with <code>tts:read</code> to discover the models enabled for your account. Do not assume that every model is available:</p><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-dark github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B392F0;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> -fS</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &#39;https://api.voicelab.uz/v1/tts/languages&#39;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &quot;Authorization: Bearer </span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">$VOICELAB_API_KEY</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Choose a public ID from <code>models[].id</code>, then list voices that support that model and language. For example, if the catalog returns <code>lison-v2</code>:</p><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-dark github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B392F0;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> -fS</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &#39;https://api.voicelab.uz/v1/voices?language=en&amp;model_id=lison-v2&#39;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &quot;Authorization: Bearer </span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">$VOICELAB_API_KEY</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Use the selected <code>models[].id</code> as <code>model_id</code> and a returned <code>data[].id</code> as <code>voice_id</code> in the generation request. Omit <code>model_id</code> to use the default Lison model (<code>lison</code>). <code>lison-v1</code> is accepted as an alias for <code>lison</code>.</p><h2 id="generate-speech" tabindex="-1">Generate speech <a class="header-anchor" href="#generate-speech" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Generate speech&quot;">​</a></h2><header class="api-endpoint" data-method="POST"><div class="api-endpoint__bar"><strong class="api-endpoint__method">POST</strong><!----><code class="api-endpoint__url" tabindex="0" aria-label="Endpoint URL">https://api.voicelab.uz/v1/tts</code><button class="api-endpoint__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy endpoint" title="Copy endpoint"><span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span><span class="api-endpoint__copy-label">Copy</span></button></div><!----><p class="api-endpoint__description">Generate a complete WAV file from text.</p><!----><span class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite"></span></header><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th style="text-align:center;">Required</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>text</code></td><td>string</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td>1 to 5,000 Unicode characters; complete JSON body at most 64 KiB</td></tr><tr><td><code>language</code></td><td>string</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td>Code returned by <code>/v1/tts/languages</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>voice_id</code></td><td>string</td><td style="text-align:center;">Yes</td><td>Opaque <code>voice_...</code> ID from <code>/v1/voices</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>model_id</code></td><td>string</td><td style="text-align:center;">No</td><td>ID from <code>models[].id</code> in <code>/v1/tts/languages</code>; defaults to <code>lison</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>speed</code></td><td>number</td><td style="text-align:center;">No</td><td><code>0.5</code> to <code>2.0</code>, default <code>1</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The selected voice must support both <code>model_id</code> and <code>language</code>. Omitted <code>model_id</code> defaults to <code>lison</code>. Omitted <code>speed</code> defaults to <code>1</code>. Explicit <code>0</code>, <code>null</code>, and strings are invalid for <code>speed</code>.</p><p>Send a unique <code>Idempotency-Key</code> with each new generation. Reuse that key only when retrying the same body.</p><p>Returns <code>200 audio/wav</code> if generation finishes within the request&#39;s wait budget. Otherwise, returns <code>202</code> JSON with <code>id</code> and <code>status_url</code>. Save only <code>200</code> audio as a WAV file. For <code>202</code>, <a href="#generate-speech-in-the-background">poll the job</a>. The examples handle both responses.</p><div class="vp-code-group vp-adaptive-theme"><div class="tabs"><input type="radio" name="group-QvaEg" id="tab-pWw14TZ" checked><label data-title="cURL" for="tab-pWw14TZ">cURL</label><input type="radio" name="group-QvaEg" id="tab-7ebJRBx"><label data-title="Python" for="tab-7ebJRBx">Python</label><input type="radio" name="group-QvaEg" id="tab-UKo-jK4"><label data-title="TypeScript" for="tab-UKo-jK4">TypeScript</label><input type="radio" name="group-QvaEg" id="tab-7L-IXGS"><label data-title="Java" for="tab-7L-IXGS">Java</label></div><div class="blocks"><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme active"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-dark github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">tts_http_status</span><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">$(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B392F0;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> -fS</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> -w</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &#39;%{http_code}&#39;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &#39;https://api.voicelab.uz/v1/tts&#39;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &quot;Authorization: Bearer </span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">$VOICELAB_API_KEY</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &#39;Content-Type: application/json&#39;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &#39;Idempotency-Key: hello-world-001&#39;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  -d</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &#39;{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">    &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Hello from VoiceLab.&quot;,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">    &quot;language&quot;: &quot;en&quot;,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">    &quot;voice_id&quot;: &quot;voice_01J9NEUTRAL0000000000000001&quot;,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">    &quot;model_id&quot;: &quot;lison-v2&quot;,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">    &quot;speed&quot;: 1</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">  }&#39;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  -o</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> tts-response</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">case</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">$tts_http_status</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;"> in</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;">  200</span><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">)</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B392F0;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;"> mv</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> tts-response</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> hello.wav</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> ;;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;">  202</span><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">)</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B392F0;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;"> cat</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> tts-response</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> ;; </span><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;"># JSON job metadata; poll status_url</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">  *)</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B392F0;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;"> cat</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> tts-response</span><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;"> &gt;&amp;2</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">; </span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">exit</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> 1</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> ;;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">esac</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="language-python vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">python</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-dark github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">import</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> os</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">import</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> requests</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
