<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#85E89D;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;">X-VoiceLab-Sample-Rate</span><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> 24000</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#85E89D;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;">X-VoiceLab-Model-ID</span><span style="--shiki-light:#F97583;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> lison-v2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>One Unicode character uses one credit. VoiceLab releases reserved credits if generation fails.</p><h2 id="generate-speech-in-the-background" tabindex="-1">Generate speech in the background <a class="header-anchor" href="#generate-speech-in-the-background" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Generate speech in the background&quot;">​</a></h2><header class="api-endpoint" data-method="POST"><div class="api-endpoint__bar"><strong class="api-endpoint__method">POST</strong><!----><code class="api-endpoint__url" tabindex="0" aria-label="Endpoint URL">https://api.voicelab.uz/v1/tts/async</code><button class="api-endpoint__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy endpoint" title="Copy endpoint"><span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span><span class="api-endpoint__copy-label">Copy</span></button></div><!----><p class="api-endpoint__description">Queue speech generation and return a status URL. Requires tts:write.</p><!----><span class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite"></span></header><p>Uses the same request fields, 5,000-character text limit and idempotency rules as <code>/v1/tts</code>. Grant <code>tts:read</code> as well to poll. The response is <code>202 Accepted</code>, with <code>Location</code>, <code>Retry-After: 1</code> and <code>X-VoiceLab-Generation-ID</code> headers:</p><div class="language-json vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">json</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-dark github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  &quot;id&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;gen_EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  &quot;model_id&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;lison-v2&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  &quot;status&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;queued&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  &quot;status_url&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;/v1/tts/generations/gen_EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  &quot;request_id&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;req_EXAMPLE&quot;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Poll <code>GET /v1/tts/generations/{id}</code> using your API key and bounded backoff. Polling returns <code>200</code> JSON even while work is pending. Inspect <code>status</code>:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Status</th><th>Next step</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>queued</code>, <code>processing</code></td><td>Wait, then poll again</td></tr><tr><td><code>completed</code></td><td>Download <code>audio_url</code>; the result includes <code>credits_used</code> and <code>credits_status: &quot;charged&quot;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>failed</code></td><td>Read <code>error</code>; <code>credits_used</code> is 0 and <code>credits_status</code> is <code>released</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Download the signed audio URL without an API key or Authorization header. Refresh the generation to obtain another URL after expiry. Repeating an async submission returns <code>202</code> for the existing job, even when its status is already terminal; poll it to retrieve the result. Keep the job ID after a timeout and resume polling. Disconnecting or deleting does not cancel pending work. Use <code>/v1/tts/generations/{id}</code>; <code>/v1/tts/jobs</code> is retired.</p><h2 id="available-languages-and-models" tabindex="-1">Available languages and models <a class="header-anchor" href="#available-languages-and-models" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Available languages and models&quot;">​</a></h2><header class="api-endpoint" data-method="GET"><div class="api-endpoint__bar"><strong class="api-endpoint__method">GET</strong><!----><code class="api-endpoint__url" tabindex="0" aria-label="Endpoint URL">https://api.voicelab.uz/v1/tts/languages</code><button class="api-endpoint__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy endpoint" title="Copy endpoint"><span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span><span class="api-endpoint__copy-label">Copy</span></button></div><!----><p class="api-endpoint__description">Return supported languages, models, formats, and sample rates.</p><!----><span class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite"></span></header><p>Requires <code>tts:read</code>. Fetch this catalog instead of hardcoding language or model names. Send the chosen <code>models[].id</code> as <code>model_id</code> to <code>/v1/tts</code> or <code>/v1/tts/async</code>, and use the same ID to filter <code>/v1/voices</code>.</p><div class="language-json vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">json</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-dark github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">{</span></span>
