<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="idempotency" tabindex="-1">Idempotency <a class="header-anchor" href="#idempotency" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Idempotency&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Keys must contain 8 to 128 letters, numbers, <code>.</code>, <code>_</code>, or <code>-</code> characters.</p><ul><li>Retry a timed-out request with the same key and the same JSON body.</li><li>Use a new key when any input changes.</li><li>A synchronous replay returns the stored WAV if completed, or a <code>202</code> job acknowledgement while pending. Async replays return <code>202</code> job metadata. Both set <code>Idempotent-Replayed: true</code>.</li><li>Reusing a key with different input returns <code>409 idempotency_key_reused</code>.</li></ul><h2 id="list-generations" tabindex="-1">List generations <a class="header-anchor" href="#list-generations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;List generations&quot;">​</a></h2><header class="api-endpoint" data-method="GET"><div class="api-endpoint__bar"><strong class="api-endpoint__method">GET</strong><!----><code class="api-endpoint__url" tabindex="0" aria-label="Endpoint URL">https://api.voicelab.uz/v1/tts/generations?limit=30&amp;cursor=&lt;opaque&gt;</code><button class="api-endpoint__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy endpoint" title="Copy endpoint"><span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span><span class="api-endpoint__copy-label">Copy</span></button></div><!----><p class="api-endpoint__description">List generated audio with cursor pagination.</p><!----><span class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite"></span></header><div class="vp-code-group vp-adaptive-theme"><div class="tabs"><input type="radio" name="group-VOKrd" id="tab-1NFcVox" checked><label data-title="cURL" for="tab-1NFcVox">cURL</label><input type="radio" name="group-VOKrd" id="tab-qNC50ra"><label data-title="Python" for="tab-qNC50ra">Python</label><input type="radio" name="group-VOKrd" id="tab-mSJiv3D"><la